{"path":"physics/models/double-star/double-star","title":"模型·双星与多星","type":"knowledge","html":"<h1>⚡ 模型·双星与多星</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>适用特征</strong>：两个天体互相绕转（双星）；三星/多星绕共同圆心匀速圆周运动。</p>\n<p><strong>风险提示</strong>：双星的轨道半径<strong>不等于</strong>两星间距；向心力是彼此的万有引力；周期必须相同（否则追不上）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>双星模型（两星间距 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span>）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>绕连线上一点 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span></span></span></span> 转动，<strong>角速度、周期相同</strong>；</li>\n<li>向心力相等：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G\\dfrac{m_1m_2}{L^2}=m_1\\omega^2r_1=m_2\\omega^2r_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"hei